					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6833238#post-4068206</guid>
				<title>That pun.</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-6833238/dr-palanez-s-proposal#post-4068206</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Nov 2018 11:47:27 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>DrGersch</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2908157</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Why didn't I think about it before.</p> <p>This is lovely, +1. And here I truly mean it, this is a favourite of mine.</p> <p>I've noticed that articles became less &quot;direct-gore horror&quot; and more metaphysics or cute kind of sci-fi.</p> <p>As a man who's there since 2009 (and who has read Clef's Archives), basically who is there for the horror porn, weirdly, I like this. There is still a lot of Lovecraft-style horror, but this new direction is truly injecting new energy and youth in the website, and we end up with a lot of great articles.</p> <p>The world is a wondrous place after all, not everything has to be so dark.</p> <p>We cheer in the dark so you may live in the light !</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
